*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: Chinese
*LanguageEncoding: UTF-8
*PCFileName: "PDFINBOX.PPD"
*Product: "(pdfinbox)"
*Manufacturer: "pdfinbox"
*ModelName: "PDF Inbox"
*ShortNickName: "PDF Inbox"
*NickName: "PDF Inbox (Virtual PDF Printer)"
*Scheme: "ipp"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:pdfinbox;MDL:PDF Inbox;CMD:PDF;"

*cupsFilter: "application/pdf 0 -"
*cupsFilter2: "application/pdf application/pdf 0 -"

*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*VariablePaperSize: True
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsManualCopies: False

*OpenUI *PageSize/纸张大小: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A3/A3: "<</PageSize[841.89 1190.55]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[419.53 595.28]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Tabloid/Tabloid: "<</PageSize[792 1224]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w558h774/自定义 197x273mm: "<</PageSize[558 774]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/纸张区域: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A3/A3: "<</PageSize[841.89 1190.55]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[419.53 595.28]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Tabloid/Tabloid: "<</PageSize[792 1224]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w558h774/自定义 197x273mm: "<</PageSize[558 774]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "0 0 595.28 841.89"
*ImageableArea A3/A3: "0 0 841.89 1190.55"
*ImageableArea A5/A5: "0 0 419.53 595.28"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "0 0 612 792"
*ImageableArea Legal/US Legal: "0 0 612 1008"
*ImageableArea Tabloid/Tabloid: "0 0 792 1224"
*ImageableArea w558h774/自定义 197x273mm: "0 0 558 774"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595.28 841.89"
*PaperDimension A3/A3: "841.89 1190.55"
*PaperDimension A5/A5: "419.53 595.28"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/US Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension Tabloid/Tabloid: "792 1224"
*PaperDimension w558h774/自定义 197x273mm: "558 774"

*OpenUI *ColorModel/颜色模式: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
*ColorModel RGB/彩色: "<</ProcessColorModel /DeviceRGB>>setpagedevice"
*ColorModel Gray/灰度: "<</ProcessColorModel /DeviceGray>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *Duplex/双面: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/单面: "<</Duplex false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/长边翻转: "<</Duplex true/Tumble false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexTumble/短边翻转: "<</Duplex true/Tumble true>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Duplex

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(001.004)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica: Standard "(001.006)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Roman: Standard "(001.007)" Standard ROM

*DefaultResolution: 300dpi
*OpenUI *Resolution/分辨率: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*Resolution 300dpi/300 dpi: "<</HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenGroup: General/通用
*OpenUI *cupsPrintQuality/打印质量: PickOne
*DefaultcupsPrintQuality: Normal
*cupsPrintQuality Draft/草稿: ""
*cupsPrintQuality Normal/普通: ""
*cupsPrintQuality High/高质量: ""
*CloseUI: *cupsPrintQuality
*CloseGroup: General

*DefaultcupsBackSide: Normal
*APPrinterIconPath: "/System/Library/Printers/Icons/Generic.pdf"
*APDialogExtension: ""
